+# (submit_forward(defer=d)); sync_deferred() fetches their output (def_output)
+# during the attention step at layer L+1 (SGLang deepseek_v4.py). With CB-JOIN, the poller splits top-k (defer_split.h)
+# and runs deferred work after immediate work (ddone flag). Without CB-JOIN, two TaskQueue tasks are used (allow_pending).
